{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "rates-venting-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.49: `rates-venting`, Rates-scale vapor venting (process 12, THC) for the gasoline-selected passenger car in Washtenaw County on road types 1 and 4, at EVERY hour of BOTH day types -- the first RunSpec here that selects more than one hour.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES. (1) The hour as part of the output time cell: 48 (day type, hour) cells, each with its own temperature, speed distribution, activity and soak fractions. (2) MultidayTankVaporVentingCalculator's cold-soak insert, operating mode 151: TVV-2's peak hour, TVV-3's tank vapor generated between a cold-soak hour and its initial hour among the SELECTED hours, TVV-4's ethanol interpolation and hourly increment, the soaking-day recurrence over days 1 to 5, TVV-5's two equation forms, TVV-6's warming gate, TVV-7's weighting by `coldSoakInitialHourFraction` (TTG-7) and the four post-peak decay hours. A one-hour run multiplies all of it by exactly zero (`rates-evap`). Measured in pandas before the port: all 3,072 rows at 1.97e-05, with the soak fractions MOVES stores to six digits.\n\nTHE BINDINGS. `n_ratesScale` = 1 and `n_outputRate` the (pollutant-process, road type, cohort) pairs, checked by `rateSurvivorCount`.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "runspec",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "rates",
      "rates-evap",
      "multi-hour"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/rates-venting/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0233_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, yearID 2020. The scope comes from these tables and never from the RunSpec XML, whose @key attributes are 0-based indices into sorted ID lists (docs/mixed-onroad.md §0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecmonth": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/rates-venting/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0233_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecmonth.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecmonth"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, monthID 8. A key of the thermal chain and not only an axis: TTG-1 starts from `zoneMonthHour` at this month, and the cold-soak tank temperature it produces is every cold trip's key-on temperature and three degrees below where every hot soak ends.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspechour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/rates-venting/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0233_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspechour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "24 rows, hourIDs 1 to 24: every hour of the day, and the first RunSpec here to select more than one. Vapor venting's cold soak pairs an hour with an earlier one of the same day among these, so this is what makes MultidayTankVaporVentingCalculator TVV-3 to TVV-7 non-zero (PLAN.md §7.3.49).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_aggregationhour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/rates-venting/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0233_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_aggregationhour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "The hours the run aggregates over. This run does not set `aggregateBy`, so it is `runspechour` itself and the same file.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/rates-venting/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0233_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechourday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "48 rows: `runspechourday`, every (hour, day type) cell, hourDayIDs 12 to 245. The output TIME CELL relation (PLAN.md §7.3.49): each is its own output row block.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_rateday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/rates-venting/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0233_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_rateday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "The day types the RATE-side time pre-aggregation is scoped to. This run does not set `aggregateBy`, so it is `runspecday` itself: 2 rows, dayIDs 2 (weekend) and 5 (weekday).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_actday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/rates-venting/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0233_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_actday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "The day types the output cells' ACTIVITY covers, and the source of `noOfRealDays`: `runspecday`, dayIDs 2 and 5 (2 and 5 real days).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecsourcetype": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/rates-venting/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0233_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecsourcetype.parquet"
      },
