        "note": "The 3,072-row RatePerProfile: vapor venting THC on road type 1, per vehicle, at every hour of both day types -- 64 cohorts x 48 cells. Hours 8 to 21 carry the cold soak (operating mode 151), up to 46 % of the hour; at night it is exactly 0, because the cold-soak tank temperature falls and TVV-6 zeroes a hour that did not warm. RatePerDistance is EMPTY too: no running process is selected, so there is no distance to divide by.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    }
